      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TO THE NINES (11) was beaten only 4.4m in his latest appearance in a Vicbred heat and had missed by a nose when fresh at Mildura prior. May need luck from this barrier but he'll be reaching peak fitness now and this should suit. GUNFORHIRE (6) has been close-up in his last two outings from the back row and was runner-up here the last time he started on this line. Big threat. BROWNIESATMIDNIGHT (12) has switched to the Lewis yard since he last raced at Menangle in June. Another with a tricky draw but he owns a strong fresh record and was readied with a trial. LAMBRO MACH (9) enjoys a class drop off the Vicbred series and did go into that off a win at this venue so can make an impact with even luck. KIA ORA BEAUTY (4) has been racing well since a Shepparton win last month and draws to advantage.",
